      "message": "I am a bit uncomfortable to merge this even as temporary patch. Can we at least restrict this to protected-debuggable VMs?\n\nNote: it might be already the case, since we have a check in first_stage_init that prevents booting non-debuggable VM with microdroid vendor partition: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/core/init/first_stage_init.cpp;l\u003d406;drc\u003db4987345ff1f97d529cc23b03ca73b58ff7a7e1b",
